 low-passed noise (klattsing glottal option, klattsch [GS=1])

Liljencrants-Fant flow derivative shaped by Fant's Rd (RD, RDE effort coupling),
KLSYN88 TL tilt, jitter drawn at glottal closure (JIT), shimmer (SHIM),
pitch-synchronous noise while voiced (AM), flutter (FL), and one-pole low-pass of
the frication / aspiration noise (NT / AT; Klatt's soft low-pass noise).
glottal: true = rd 1, rdEffort 6, jitter 0.5, shimmer 5, aspMod 1, noiseTilt 15.

Fidelity (kokoro-durations + mitalk-bursts): score 0.367 -> 1.039, MCD 4.79 -> 3.98,
mcd_cmn 3.73 -> 3.66, mcd_static 2.95 -> 1.50 (LF alone: 0.575).
Whisper pairs: 46.8% -> 46.0%, McNemar p = 1. Defaults byte-identical (audio hash test).

